C.3 Resource-Aware Scheduling

The scheduling problem is formalized as a multiple-choice knapsack:

\max_{x_{ir}} \sum_{i,r} U(\tau_i, r) x_{ir} \quad \text{s.t.} \sum_i c_i x_{ir} \leq C_r, \sum_r x_{ir} \leq 1

where U(\tau_i, r) = \frac{\text{Criticality}_i \times \text{Confidence}_i}{\text{Energy}_i \times \text{Latency}_i}.

